This notice is issued by {{party: acme}} to O'Brien "Holdings" Ltd. as addressee.

# Notice {#notice}

The notice period is {{duration: 30, unit=D}}.

The contacts listed in {{attach: contacts}} remain responsible for the assets.

Delivery is made by e-mail \[only\].

The notice takes effect immediately
upon delivery.
